    "2026-10-18: Remove TomlJ compile-only checker annotations and JPacker optional CLI to avoid new build dependencies",
    "2026-10-18: Monte AVI MJPEG reader selects the JDK standard JPEG ImageReader through public ImageIO rather than an inaccessible com.sun implementation",
    "2026-10-18: Remove unused GNUJPDF import of jdk.internal.reflect.Reflection; no executable behavior changed",
    "2026-10-18: Persist unsupported image/native-codec diagnostics across upstream catch handlers; export process fails even if rendering substitutes an error image",
    "2026-10-18: Retain original .flex/.g4 lexer/grammar inputs beside generated Java in preferred-form source bundle",
